00:04:16.137 --> 00:04:20.297
agents on Amazon Web Services, or AWS Infrastructure.

00:04:21.342 --> 00:04:26.242
Neural network weight tensors, not images, are what a small diffusion model on the machine-learning

00:04:26.242 --> 00:04:31.802
subreddit was trained to emit, with a proof-of-concept repository and web demo that lets users

00:04:31.802 --> 00:04:34.762
